I've encountered them in games where my experience level was less than
20.

Once you get the Amulet, maximum monster difficulty is based on the
deepest level the player reached averaged with his experience level.
Even if the player is still level 14 (from the quest), if the Sanctum
is on level 50, then you can expect to encounter monsters of difficulty
32 (or even 33).  I don't think Archons are ranked even that high,
although it's difficult to tell for sure because monsters don't seem to
have a "difficulty" entry in the definition structure in the source.  I
think difficulty is computer internally during the game, although I
don't know how.

